<title>BELGIUM: EU backs Italy's EMU plan, urges further action.</title>
<headline>EU backs Italy's EMU plan, urges further action.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Monday welcomed Italy's efforts to join its single currency but urged it to adopt further measures to reform its welfare state.</p>
<p>EU finance ministers said that the economic assumptions underlying Italy's convergence plan were &quot;reasonable&quot; but also dependent on low inflation and the &quot;successful implementation of...structural budgetary adjustment.&quot;</p>
</text>
